{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d72caa243ca3a561","name":"Silas Draver","source":{"id":"source:reference-d72caa243ca3a561","title":"Silas Draver","revision":21742,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:23:39Z","sha256":"693480bd5a534863e3ea7df70b97d96da6da68e351e36ace0a314ce805750d0c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21742","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Silas%20Draver&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d72caa243ca3a561","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Queen of Air and Darkness"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Queen_of_Air_and_Darkness","referenceId":"reference:807bd67869870b44"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," man has a dashing air about him, with his long, black ponytail, a drooping mustache, and a suit made in the finest Corellian fashion. He offers a grin that can only be described as arrogant, and he seems to carry enough swagger to put many nobles to shame."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Silas Draver is a good gambler, but he knows he is not the best. Though he came to the Cloud City Sabacc Tournament hoping to win, he took no chances on coming away with the prize money. Since he owes his entry fee to a loan shark on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nar Shaddaa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nar_Shaddaa","referenceId":"reference:69680e00e40913c9"},", Draver is unlikely to give up the credits without a fight- he knows that a fate worse than death awaits him if he fails to pay back the loan. Draver bribed one of the technicians in the Royal Casino to implant software that allowed him to trigger the Droids' defense systems (illegal defense systems, which ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jacc Mandelbrot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jacc_Mandelbrot?action=edit&redlink=1"}," thought were installed in secret) in case he lost out of the tournament. Draver has a ship waiting for him on a nearby landing platform, and he believes that he should be able to get away without too much trouble.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Silas Draver Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +11; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 22 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 19), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 18, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 22\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 42